### Burst Admin Endpoints
### These are admin-only endpoints for managing burst blocks

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@staticToken = {{$dotenv STATIC_TOKEN}}

### Get all currently blocked users
GET {{baseUrl}}/static/admin/burst/blocked-users
Authorization: Bearer {{staticToken}}

### Unblock a specific user by ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/static/admin/burst/unblock/123
Authorization: Bearer {{staticToken}}

### Unblock all users
POST {{baseUrl}}/static/admin/burst/unblock-all
Authorization: Bearer {{staticToken}}

### Production endpoints
@prodBaseUrl = https://api.decorebator.com
@prodStaticToken = {{$dotenv PROD_STATIC_TOKEN}}

### Get all currently blocked users (Production)
GET {{prodBaseUrl}}/static/admin/burst/blocked-users
Authorization: Bearer {{prodStaticToken}}

### Unblock a specific user by ID (Production)
POST {{prodBaseUrl}}/static/admin/burst/unblock/123
Authorization: Bearer {{prodStaticToken}}

### Unblock all users (Production)
POST {{prodBaseUrl}}/static/admin/burst/unblock-all
Authorization: Bearer {{prodStaticToken}}